OBJETIVO PROFISSIONAL}
{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql{\f5\b0
Desenvolvedor Full Stack | APIs e microsservi\u231\'e7os (Java/Python, Spring Boot/FastAPI) | Oracle DB e MongoDB | Front-end moderno (JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML5/CSS3, React/Angular e ecossistema Node.js)}
{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\f5\b0

{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql{\f5\b
RESUMO EXECUTIVO}
{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql{\f5\b0
Profissional s\u234\'eanior de Tecnologia da Informa\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o, com mais de 20 anos de experi\u234\'eancia em ambientes corporativos de alta criticidade. Forte base em dados e integra\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o (PL/SQL, Oracle, ETL, Python), com atua\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o em ambientes heterog\u234\'eaneos que incluem Oracle DB, SQL Server, PostgreSQL e MongoDB. Experi\u234\'eancia com entregas em pipeline (Git Flow, Jenkins), automa\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o e evolu\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o de sistemas transacionais e integra\u231\'e7\u245\'f5es. Perfil alinhado a desenvolvimento full stack: evolu\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o de APIs e servi\u231\'e7os, integra\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o REST/GraphQL, interfaces web (incluindo Oracle APEX) e foco em seguran\u231\'e7a, performance, escalabilidade e qualidade.}
{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\f5\b0

