COMPET\u202\'caNCIAS }
{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\hich\af5\ab0\dbch\ab0\loch\f5\b0\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\f5\b
IA}
{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1046\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1046\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1046\ql{\rtlch\ab0\ltrch\f5\b0
Uso de IA para automatizar processos, melhorar performance de programas, melhoras com evolu\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o de programas, implementa\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o de novas funcionalidades.\line Curso feito com a HashtagTreinamentos e aplica\u231\'e7\u227\'e3o no dia a dia }
